1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,543
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,543 --> 00:00:14,033
=Episode 16=
(Uncle Ghost's all set. Don't worry.)

3
00:00:14,301 --> 00:00:16,181
You said you need my support.

4
00:00:17,461 --> 00:00:21,221
- For what?
- I want Prosperity back first.

5
00:00:24,701 --> 00:00:25,821
I'm too tired today.

6
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,021
You may leave now.

7
00:00:29,221 --> 00:00:30,221
Thank you, Your Highness.

8
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:32,821
Thank you, Your Highness.

9
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,580
Your Highness, I apologize.

10
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:43,021
I made a mistake. It won't happen again.

11
00:00:47,701 --> 00:00:50,100
Linna, you've been working for me
for so many years.

12
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:51,581
This is the first time

13
00:00:51,621 --> 00:00:52,981
and the last time.

14
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:55,220
Get up.

15
00:00:56,341 --> 00:00:57,341
But Your Highness,

16
00:00:58,061 --> 00:00:59,780
are you really going to support him?

17
00:01:00,021 --> 00:01:02,500
Why does the Grand Princess
want the evidence too?

18
00:01:02,581 --> 00:01:03,981
The king is bedridden,

19
00:01:04,581 --> 00:01:06,140
and the young prince has been overseas.

20
00:01:06,941 --> 00:01:08,981
She has been running things
all these years.

21
00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:10,140
I know that.

22
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,701
The young prince has come of age

23
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:12,981
and is bound to take the throne.

24
00:01:12,981 --> 00:01:15,140
Do you think
someone used to holding power

25
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:16,981
would just let it go?

26
00:01:17,741 --> 00:01:19,101
He has leverage now.

27
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:20,940
So he gets to negotiate with me.

28
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:23,380
But I'm not really trying to back him.

29
00:01:23,981 --> 00:01:25,981
I just want to rattle the Nie family.

30
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:28,220
Elder Nie used to be
the young prince's tutor.

31
00:01:28,741 --> 00:01:29,981
If the Nie family falls,

32
00:01:29,981 --> 00:01:31,821
it will definitely
hurt the young prince.

33
00:01:32,020 --> 00:01:33,140
Even though Nie Feng

34
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,341
has been siding with the Grand Princess,

35
00:01:36,341 --> 00:01:38,140
she has never trusted him.

36
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,140
It's just Prosperity.

37
00:01:40,901 --> 00:01:42,380
I can set the stage for him.

38
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:43,741
Whether he can take it back

39
00:01:44,901 --> 00:01:46,380
depends on his own ability.

40
00:01:47,341 --> 00:01:48,860
If you let the Grand Princess

41
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:49,860
release the evidence,

42
00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:52,101
we can bring down the Nie family
just the same.

43
00:01:52,101 --> 00:01:53,341
What's truly terrifying

44
00:01:53,341 --> 00:01:55,140
is having a blade
hanging over your head,

45
00:01:55,341 --> 00:01:56,580
not knowing when it will fall.

46
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:57,940
Nie Feng has the evidence.

47
00:01:58,101 --> 00:01:59,981
So the blade over their head

48
00:02:00,461 --> 00:02:02,420
keeps them in constant dread.

49
00:02:02,860 --> 00:02:03,860
We have to

50
00:02:04,261 --> 00:02:05,380
strike the final blow.

51
00:02:37,861 --> 00:02:39,100
I want to report Tang Zhen.

52
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:43,700
Got any proof?

53
00:02:44,341 --> 00:02:46,141
I've got plenty of proof
of his corruption

54
00:02:46,141 --> 00:02:47,220
over the years.

55
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:48,940
It's all here.

56
00:02:50,901 --> 00:02:52,380
It's time for Tang Zhen to pay

57
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:54,220
for what he did.

58
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,260
Su Yunian.

59
00:02:58,940 --> 00:03:00,540
Tu Jiasheng is out.

60
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:03,141
Not only is he out,

61
00:03:03,421 --> 00:03:04,940
he even brought that female guard,

62
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:07,220
Xia Yuyan, out with him.

63
00:03:09,901 --> 00:03:10,901
Is there

64
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:14,621
any justice left in this country?

65
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:17,621
If you really want justice
for your sister,

66
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:21,700
figure out what he's up to.

67
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,540
I wouldn't let him off if I were you.

68
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:34,780
Hello?

69
00:03:35,621 --> 00:03:36,621
Yeah.

70
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,980
I'll bring them over right away.

71
00:03:40,461 --> 00:03:41,581
Go get Bai Ruxue.

72
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:43,861
- The Grand Princess wants to see us.
- Yes, sir.

73
00:03:43,861 --> 00:03:44,861
And you.

74
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:46,100
Come along.

75
00:03:49,461 --> 00:03:50,461
Greetings, Your Highness.

76
00:03:53,581 --> 00:03:54,581
Nie Feng,

77
00:03:55,461 --> 00:03:56,700
do you think

78
00:03:56,940 --> 00:03:59,741
I'm backing Tang Niansen
to run against you?

79
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:01,901
Please don't make fun of me.

80
00:04:02,061 --> 00:04:03,980
I've never thought that.

81
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:06,461
Elections are fair competition.

82
00:04:06,461 --> 00:04:08,540
It's only natural to have opponents.

83
00:04:10,301 --> 00:04:11,581
How open-minded of you.

84
00:04:11,741 --> 00:04:13,100
I've been busy with the campaign

85
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:14,741
and haven't visited you much.

86
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:16,301
Please forgive me.

87
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:18,301
The young prince

88
00:04:18,461 --> 00:04:19,621
has been staying quiet

89
00:04:19,741 --> 00:04:20,940
without making any moves.

90
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,220
I have a task for you.

91
00:04:23,341 --> 00:04:24,341
At your command.

92
00:04:24,581 --> 00:04:25,581
Next week,

93
00:04:25,621 --> 00:04:27,221
the envoy from Dongdao is visiting.

94
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:29,340
Besides the public banquet,

95
00:04:29,661 --> 00:04:32,181
a private dinner will be held

96
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:35,421
for the delegation's core leadership
to meet with me privately.

97
00:04:36,741 --> 00:04:38,981
I wanted to host it at Prosperity.

98
00:04:39,020 --> 00:04:40,781
We will spare no effort.

99
00:04:41,340 --> 00:04:42,340
But I've heard

100
00:04:43,101 --> 00:04:44,260
that Prosperity

101
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:46,781
is nothing like
what it was under Tu Jiasheng.

102
00:04:46,781 --> 00:04:48,541
Do you think Prosperity, as it is today,

103
00:04:48,621 --> 00:04:50,221
is fit to host the envoy?

104
00:04:51,661 --> 00:04:53,781
I'll straighten things out immediately.

105
00:04:53,781 --> 00:04:54,781
It's too late.

106
00:04:54,861 --> 00:04:55,861
This time,

107
00:04:56,061 --> 00:04:57,580
we'll host it at my manor.

108
00:04:57,781 --> 00:04:58,781
Understood.

109
00:04:58,781 --> 00:04:59,820
However,

110
00:05:01,061 --> 00:05:02,781
your people can run the banquet.

111
00:05:03,061 --> 00:05:04,061
Bai Ruxue,

112
00:05:04,421 --> 00:05:06,340
you'll be in charge of drinks.

113
00:05:08,380 --> 00:05:09,380
Su Yunian,

114
00:05:10,061 --> 00:05:11,181
you'll be in charge of the food.

115
00:05:11,820 --> 00:05:13,580
Coordinate with Linna on this.

116
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,940
Understood, I will give it my all

117
00:05:16,061 --> 00:05:17,181
to make it perfect.

118
00:05:20,301 --> 00:05:21,301
Your Highness,

119
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:23,940
that's not Su Yunian's
usual line of work.

120
00:05:24,221 --> 00:05:25,940
She might make mistakes.

121
00:05:26,061 --> 00:05:27,340
Why don't you let me do it?

122
00:05:27,340 --> 00:05:28,340
Silence.

123
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:29,781
Since when do you

124
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:32,221
get to question
Her Highness's decisions?

125
00:05:33,301 --> 00:05:35,340
This visit by the Dongdao envoy

126
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:38,421
is far beyond
a standard diplomatic visit.

127
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:39,900
If you can reach

128
00:05:40,181 --> 00:05:42,781
an agreement on cooperation this time,

129
00:05:43,061 --> 00:05:45,380
it will be a massive boost
to your campaign.

130
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:47,500
Thank you, Your Highness.

131
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:48,580
Tang Niansen

132
00:05:48,861 --> 00:05:50,580
will also be there.

133
00:05:51,101 --> 00:05:53,621
He worked at ASEAN for some time

134
00:05:53,661 --> 00:05:56,301
and has plenty of experience
dealing with Dongdao.

135
00:05:58,340 --> 00:05:59,820
You don't mind, do you?

136
00:06:01,700 --> 00:06:02,700
Of course not.

137
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:05,221
It'll be a good chance
to learn from him.

138
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:07,580
Good.

139
00:06:08,621 --> 00:06:09,621
Go see to it.

140
00:06:10,260 --> 00:06:11,260
Yes, Your Highness.

141
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:39,020
Dad.

142
00:06:40,661 --> 00:06:41,661
Mom.

143
00:06:43,101 --> 00:06:44,741
Don't leave me.

144
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:45,940
Don't.

145
00:06:49,781 --> 00:06:50,781
Uncle Ghost.

146
00:06:52,101 --> 00:06:53,101
Uncle Ghost.

147
00:06:55,981 --> 00:06:56,981
Uncle Ghost.

148
00:06:57,421 --> 00:06:59,340
Uncle Ghost.

149
00:07:04,301 --> 00:07:05,301
Had a nightmare?

150
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:17,140
Sorry,

151
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:19,181
I made you worry.

152
00:07:20,181 --> 00:07:21,181
Have some water.

153
00:07:26,580 --> 00:07:27,820
Can someone like me

154
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:31,020
never get a peaceful night's sleep?

155
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:32,020
Peace

156
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:34,421
is never granted.

157
00:07:34,541 --> 00:07:35,981
You have to fight for it.

158
00:07:47,580 --> 00:07:48,900
Looks like it's time

159
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:50,580
to return this key to you.

160
00:07:56,861 --> 00:07:57,861
Tu Jiasheng,

161
00:07:58,661 --> 00:08:00,621
did you forget what you promised me?

162
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:01,940
No, I didn't.

163
00:08:02,421 --> 00:08:03,580
Once we take down Nie Feng,

164
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:05,580
we can find out how An Ruoxi died.

165
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:08,020
I'm just waiting for the right moment.

166
00:08:08,181 --> 00:08:09,181
Waiting?

167
00:08:09,621 --> 00:08:10,781
Until when?

168
00:08:11,621 --> 00:08:13,500
Until you completely
forget about my sister?

169
00:08:14,301 --> 00:08:15,940
Yunian, you got it wrong.

170
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:17,781
Don't make excuses for him.
Let him speak.

171
00:08:25,260 --> 00:08:26,260
Su Yunian,

172
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:27,500
please trust me.

173
00:08:28,301 --> 00:08:30,140
I haven't forgotten about your sister.

174
00:08:45,141 --> 00:08:47,181
The Grand Princess
is hosting a banquet at her manor

175
00:08:47,340 --> 00:08:49,100
for the envoy from Dongdao.

176
00:08:49,901 --> 00:08:52,580
Nie Feng and Secretary Tang
will both be there.

177
00:08:53,061 --> 00:08:54,421
Bai Ruxue is in charge of drinks,

178
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:55,580
and I'm in charge of the food.

179
00:08:55,980 --> 00:08:56,980
She was quite upset.

180
00:08:58,860 --> 00:08:59,860
Good job.

181
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:01,901
But Bai Ruxue

182
00:09:02,141 --> 00:09:03,301
is petty-minded.

183
00:09:03,781 --> 00:09:05,781
She won't just let you
steal her spotlight.

184
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:07,820
Be very careful.

185
00:09:09,781 --> 00:09:10,781
Got it.

186
00:09:14,980 --> 00:09:15,980
This banquet

187
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:18,700
must be the stage
the Grand Princess set for us.

188
00:09:33,951 --> 00:09:34,980
It's for you.

189
00:09:34,980 --> 00:09:35,980
Thank you.

190
00:09:41,061 --> 00:09:42,061
Welcome, Mr. Envoy.

191
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:44,940
You've traveled a long way.

192
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:46,381
You're too kind, Your Highness.

193
00:09:46,541 --> 00:09:48,580
I've long admired
your country's splendor.

194
00:09:48,781 --> 00:09:50,141
I've prepared a modest feast.

195
00:09:50,141 --> 00:09:52,340
I hope you enjoy it. After you.

196
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:54,541
Hello, Mr. Envoy. I'm Nie Feng.

197
00:09:54,541 --> 00:09:56,381
It's an honor to meet you.

198
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:58,781
Mr. Nie, pleasure to meet you.

199
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:01,580
Mr. Envoy.

200
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:05,580
I didn't expect
to see you again so soon.

201
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:08,100
Good to see you, Tang.

202
00:10:10,141 --> 00:10:11,688
How have you been?

203
00:10:13,061 --> 00:10:14,740
Mr. Tang was thorough and reliable

204
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:16,460
during his years at ASEAN.

205
00:10:16,460 --> 00:10:17,980
Having such talent

206
00:10:18,021 --> 00:10:19,580
is truly a blessing for your country.

207
00:10:21,301 --> 00:10:22,620
You flatter me, sir.

208
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:24,301
So, Mr. Envoy,

209
00:10:24,301 --> 00:10:26,421
you and Mr. Tang are old friends.

210
00:10:26,740 --> 00:10:27,781
Looks like

211
00:10:27,781 --> 00:10:29,580
it will be a pleasant evening.

212
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:30,980
Tang.

213
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:33,781
- Let's catch up later.
- Alright.

214
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:38,301
Hold the cold dishes for thirty seconds.

215
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:40,580
Wait for my signal on the soup.

216
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:44,501
Also, the envoy's team
has severe seafood allergies,

217
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,740
so prepare the oysters separately.

218
00:10:47,061 --> 00:10:48,620
They must not share a prep counter

219
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:49,661
with other dishes.

220
00:10:49,661 --> 00:10:50,661
Understood.

221
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:51,700
Thank you.

222
00:11:00,661 --> 00:11:03,381
Ms. Bai, food and wine pairing
matters a lot.

223
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:05,141
Strictly follow the plan.

224
00:11:05,141 --> 00:11:07,700
Make sure you don't mix anything up.

225
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:09,021
I don't need your instructions.

226
00:11:09,141 --> 00:11:10,541
Just mind your own business.

227
00:11:15,141 --> 00:11:16,141
Everyone is seated.

228
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:17,940
- Get ready to serve.
- Yes, ma'am.

229
00:11:20,940 --> 00:11:22,061
Mr. Envoy, welcome.

230
00:11:22,061 --> 00:11:23,661
- Welcome.
- Come on.

231
00:11:30,100 --> 00:11:31,100
Your Highness,

232
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:33,700
we've always valued

233
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:36,261
your country's resources and location.

234
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:39,381
However, the security situation
along our border

235
00:11:39,661 --> 00:11:40,860
puts our companies

236
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:42,181
on edge.

237
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:44,541
Investment isn't about courage.

238
00:11:45,021 --> 00:11:46,340
It's about responsibility.

239
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:49,100
Indeed.

240
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:52,580
Mr. Envoy,

241
00:11:53,541 --> 00:11:55,620
we will not avoid the security issue.

242
00:11:55,820 --> 00:11:57,740
But if we only discuss the risk
and not the reward,

243
00:11:57,980 --> 00:12:00,100
your companies wouldn't be drawn

244
00:12:00,501 --> 00:12:01,501
to invest here.

245
00:12:04,261 --> 00:12:05,740
We are certainly willing to invest.

246
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:07,979
We just need a clear,
firm security commitment

247
00:12:07,979 --> 00:12:10,541
from your country.

248
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:14,620
Mr. Envoy,

249
00:12:14,620 --> 00:12:15,740
the banditry along the border

250
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,100
didn't happen overnight,

251
00:12:17,781 --> 00:12:19,301
yet it is far from unsolvable.

252
00:12:19,501 --> 00:12:20,860
My stance is clear.

253
00:12:21,381 --> 00:12:22,460
Strike hard

254
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:23,620
with zero tolerance.

255
00:12:24,141 --> 00:12:25,141
Whoever makes trouble

256
00:12:25,301 --> 00:12:26,381
gets crushed.

257
00:12:45,150 --> 00:12:48,766
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

258
00:12:49,136 --> 00:12:53,121
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

259
00:12:57,877 --> 00:13:01,196
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

260
00:13:01,196 --> 00:13:06,281
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

261
00:13:09,870 --> 00:13:16,422
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

262
00:13:16,422 --> 00:13:24,843
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

263
00:13:24,843 --> 00:13:28,072
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

264
00:13:28,072 --> 00:13:31,267
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

265
00:13:31,267 --> 00:13:33,960
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

266
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:38,577
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

267
00:13:42,488 --> 00:13:44,977
♪Burning alone♪

268
00:13:50,483 --> 00:13:56,852
♪The glory fades♪
